stymied
by the Current in the semi-final, here are five things that will decide a n=
ew winner in 2026.

Washington=E2=80=99s defensive pressure
Washington have allowed the second-fewest goals in the NWSL this year. Thro=
ugh the season and into the playoffs, the center-back pairing of the Englis=
h defender Esme Morgan and Tara Rudd, the Scottish goalkeeper Sandy MacIver=
 (fourth-highest save percentage in NWSL) and the defensive midfielder Andi=
 Sullivan have been tough to break through for even the league=E2=80=99s mo=
st elite attackers. Further up the field, the Spirit=E2=80=99s defense begi=
ns with an attacking unit fond of forcing mistakes that lead to goals, with=
 the late-season addition of
https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTN=
tZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgxfRFYzxnPuwuiy1ARU35PqHpUfFpdCIq3Zq=
