Clara Luvanga
(who has seven goal contributions in seven games for the Spirit) a key impa=
ct.

Kansas City, who have scored more goals than any other NWSL team this year,=
 will be a challenge. Defending set pieces will be a space to watch, as the=
y provided the only goal Utah scored against the Spirit in the semi-final, =
and all the goals Kansas City scored against Gotham.


Tara Rudd of Washington Spirit clears under pressure from Kate Del Fava of =
Utah Royals. Photograph: Scott Taetsch/NWSL/Getty Images


Bethune on a mission against former team
This season=E2=80=99s Midfielder of the Year is representing a team in the =
NWSL Championship for the third straight year (her second with availability=
 to play). But this will be her first
not
representing the Spirit. After
https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTN=
tZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgFzL7TTET9Xkltvg_gChNgDMtWxz8ELwvoB5=
